cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. / Se utilizar este software, cite-o conforme abaixo."
title: "Certifica Ciência: a bilingual batch certificate generator"
abstract: >-
  Certifica Ciência is a single-file, browser-based application that generates
  batch PDF certificates for courses, scientific events and extension projects.
  It offers a Portuguese/English interface, customizable background, corner logos,
  scanned signatures, an optional syllabus back page, participant import from Excel,
  sequential registration numbers and an exportable registry of issued certificates.
  All processing runs locally in the browser. Developed by the Artificial
  Intelligence in the Cerrado Research Group (PGAC/UEMS, Brazil).
type: software
